    "description": "Closed Mentalism 3.10 - Telekinesis. Spells for moving objects at a distance (Telekinesis), pinning objects in place with directional pressure (Staying), and hurling objects as ranged attacks (Hurling), plus a mastery spell combining the whole list.",
    "spells": [
      {
        "name": "01. Telekinesis I",
        "img": "systems/rmss/assets/default/spell.svg",
        "system": {
          "favorite": false,
          "instant": false,
          "level": 1,
          "area_of_effect": "1 lb",
          "duration": "1 min/lvl(C)",
          "range": "100'",
          "type": "F",
          "subType": "-",
          "attack_table": "",
          "skillName": "",
          "description": "Caster can move one object, up to 1 pound in mass, up to 1' per second (with no acceleration). If the caster stops concentration before the duration is up, the object remains stationary as if it had a Staying spell with an equal weight limit cast upon it."
        }
      },
